# What Cloud Build does not need to see. Everything left is what the browser
# actually asks for, plus the server that answers.

.git/
.gitignore

# the test harness — 10 MB of fixtures, and nothing a served page requests
lab/

# documentation, and the PowerShell scripts that only make sense on a dev box
# (server.ps1 and start.ps1 stay behind; deploy.ps1 runs FROM here, not IN the
# image, so it is not needed either)
docs/
*.md
*.html.bak
*.ps1

# an empty stray folder
Pink Petal Closet/

# the write-up. It is not part of the app, and shipping it would publish it at
# a guessable URL alongside the app for no reason.
Pink_Petal_Closet_*

# The lookbook's nine stock photographs. That feature was removed, and a grep
# of every js and html file finds no reference to any of them — only
# mannequin_base.jpg, which the render is built on, is still used. Left on disk
# and kept out of the image: ~5 MB that would otherwise be uploaded, stored and
# served to the public to no end.
assets/mannequin_*.jpg
!assets/mannequin_base.jpg
